# スライド (design 11.11), for tools/ui_run.py: the sample of TADjs Desktop
# (実時間TADデモ) shown a slide at a time, to the end and closed. The menu of
# the second button opens with the item chosen last on the pointer's row,
# the rows 20 pixels apart: 閉じる, line, 次へ進む, 前に戻る, ジャンプ, line,
# 再表示, 背景色変更, line, 印刷..., ウインドウ, 小物, 実行.
open 72c584f2-af6c-45cb-8dfc-3f181d13cd0a
expect slide: 1 of 3
wait 300
shot slide_1
click 640 400
expect slide: 2 of 3
wait 300
shot slide_2
# the menu, put away with Escape; then ジャンプ (Ctrl+J) taken with Enter: the slide it was on
click 640 400 1
expect slide: menu
wait 500
shot slide_menu
key 29
wait 300
key 0D 01
wait 500
shot slide_jump
key 28
expect slide: 2 of 3
wait 300
# 前に戻る of the menu (閉じる under the pointer, 前に戻る three rows below)
click 640 400 1
expect slide: menu
wait 300
click 648 460
expect slide: chosen slide.prev
expect slide: 1 of 3
wait 300
# 次へ進む (前に戻る under the pointer, 次へ進む the row above), twice
click 640 400 1
wait 300
click 648 380
expect slide: 2 of 3
wait 300
click 640 400 1
wait 300
click 648 400
expect slide: 3 of 3
wait 300
shot slide_3
key 4F
wait 300
shot slide_end
click 640 400
expect slide: closed
wait 300
shot slide_closed
# nothing it did was refused for want of a right
absent !OACV!
